--- !u!114 &7010363956658222291
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6683409677495189218}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4ce7b3f141afcd943a17cdbffa177596, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SpiritRemnantEncounter
  interactionRadius: 7
  interactionCenter: {fileID: 0}
  ambientMotion: {fileID: 0}
  goalsPanelUI: {fileID: 0}
  firstMeeting:
  - speaker: SPIRIT REMNANT
    words: A living wizard...? No living soul has wandered these ruins in ages.
  - speaker: VAN AERT
    words: What happened to this place?
  - speaker: SPIRIT REMNANT
    words: Broken Language stole our voices. Our kingdom fell silent long before
      its walls fell.
  - speaker: VAN AERT
    words: I'm looking for a little girl. Bright blue eyes. Have you seen her?
  - speaker: SPIRIT REMNANT
    words: A child...? Yes. She wandered this village, lost and crying. The Hollow
      Knight took her for a sacrifice.
  - speaker: VAN AERT
    words: A sacrifice? No... Where did he take her?
  - speaker: SPIRIT REMNANT
    words: I fear what remains of her is no longer whole. Her existence has been
      shattered into fragments across this cursed book.
  - speaker: VAN AERT
    words: Shattered...? What do you mean, shattered?
  - speaker: SPIRIT REMNANT
    words: Pieces of who she is have been separated and imprisoned. Broken Language
      can unravel more than words.
  - speaker: VAN AERT
    words: But... how is that possible?
  - speaker: SPIRIT REMNANT
    words: I do not know how it was done. I know only that her soul is no longer
      whole.
  - speaker: VAN AERT
    words: Where? Where did those fragments go? Are they still somewhere inside this
      book?
  - speaker: SPIRIT REMNANT
    words: I cannot tell you where all have gone. But the Hollow Knight may hold
      the answers you seek.
  - speaker: VAN AERT
    words: The Hollow Knight... Where can I find him?
  - speaker: SPIRIT REMNANT
    words: Beyond these ruins, within the Royal Castle. Beware, wizard. Many entered
      those halls. None returned.
  - speaker: VAN AERT
    words: The Royal Castle...
  repeatMeeting:
  - speaker: VAN AERT
    words: Remind me. Where did you say the Hollow Knight took her?
  - speaker: SPIRIT REMNANT
    words: The Royal Castle, beyond the ruins. I know nothing of the other fragments.
      Please, be careful.
